    "HD3-A12": "NARROWS S3 and S7: scoped specialization can be a real improvement without broad generality or future-flexibility gain.",
    "HD3-F03": "Strong SUPPORT for scoped-authority boundary; true causal expertise did not transfer to therapy.",
    "HD3-D02": "NARROWS immediate evaluation/option-value interpretation; no frozen invariant says intractable-now means worthless-forever."
